# Google Drive backup (optional).
#
# Without this the app works exactly as before, storing readings in the browser
# only, and the Drive card in Settings explains that it is switched off.
#
# Create this in its OWN Google Cloud project - do not reuse a client ID from
# another app. The consent screen is per-project, so a shared one would show
# the wrong app name when connecting, and the apps would not be cleanly
# isolated from each other.
#
# Setup is in README.md under "Backing up to Google Drive".
NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
